{"id": 7, "ts": 1780637757.8265455, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 1, "agent": "james_carter", "message": "I appreciate Emily\u2019s case for Candidate\u202fB, especially his reliability and stress resilience. However, I\u2019m concerned that B\u2019s weak memory for numbers directly undermines attention and information accuracy\u2014an essential safety\u2011critical capability for long\u2011distance flights where precise fuel, weight, and navigation calculations are routine. In contrast, Candidate\u202fD shows very strong concentration, exceptional problem\u2011solving ability, and a serious sense of responsibility, all of which are core to operational reliability and decision quality on international routes. While D\u2019s hot temper and know\u2011it\u2011all reputation raise crew\u2011cooperation concerns, those behaviours are more amenable to coaching and cultural fit interventions than a fundamental deficit in numerical recall. For that reason, I currently recommend Candidate\u202fD as the best overall fit."}
